        "example": "People vs problem: 'I'm frustrated by the delay' not 'You're incompetent.' | Interests: 'We need payment certainty' not 'Pay within 30 days.' The interest can be met in multiple ways. | Options: Brainstorm before evaluating. 'What if we tried X? What about Y?' | Objective criteria: 'Industry standard royalty is 5-8%' not 'I think 5% is fair.' External benchmarks reduce emotion.",
