        "definition": "Identify the gap between current state and desired future state, then develop strategies to close it. Systematic performance improvement planning.",
        "example": "Revenue gap: Current $10M ARR, target $50M in 3 years. Gap = $40M. Break into: organic growth ($20M), new products ($10M), market expansion ($10M). Each gets its own strategy. | Capability gap: Need AI/ML but have no data scientists. Gap closure options: hire (6 months, $500k/year), acquire small AI startup (3 months, $5M), partner with AI platform (1 month, revenue share). | Process: Define current state → Define desired state → Identify root causes of gap → Generate options → Select and implement.",
