        "example": "Vietnam expansion: political stability (good), economic growth (strong, 6-8% GDP), IP protection (moderate — improving but weaker than US/EU), infrastructure (ports good, inland logistics challenging). Overall: invest, but with local partner for regulatory navigation. | Russia post-2022: political risk (extreme — sanctions, unpredictability), economic (volatile), legal (no effective contract enforcement with Western companies). Assessment: exit or dramatically reduce exposure. | Use external ratings (World Bank Governance Indicators, Transparency International CPI, S&P Country Risk) as baselines, then add company-specific factors.",
