    "example": "Coca-Cola brand: Valuable (drives purchase), Rare (one of top 5 global brands), Inimitable (130+ years of marketing can't be copied), Organized (global distribution system). Sustainable competitive advantage. | Google search algorithm: Valuable (80%+ of search ad revenue), Rare (only one at this scale), Inimitable (20+ years of data + engineering), Organized (massive infrastructure). | Generic retailer's 'great customer service': Valuable, not rare (everyone claims it), not inimitable (competitors can copy policies). Temporary parity, not advantage.",
