    "example": "Aircraft engine: Failure mode = turbine blade crack. Severity 10 (catastrophic), Occurrence 2 (rare), Detection 4 (inspections catch half). RPN = 80. Prioritize. | Medical device: Failure mode = incorrect dosage display. Severity 9, Occurrence 3, Detection 8 (display test catches most). RPN = 216. Top priority fix. | Not severe: App crashes on obscure edge case affecting 0.01% of users. Severity 2, Occurrence 1, Detection 5. RPN = 10. Fix eventually.",
