    "example": "Duty of Care: Director reads board materials before meeting, asks questions, understands the business. Not just showing up. | Duty of Loyalty: Director discloses that their spouse works at a vendor the company is considering. Recuses from vote. No self-dealing. | Duty of Good Faith: Director can't consciously ignore red flags. 'I didn't know about the fraud' doesn't work if you deliberately avoided knowing.",
