    "formula": null,
    "example": "Two suspects, no communication. Both stay silent = 1 year each. Both confess = 5 years each. One confesses while other stays silent = confesse goes free, silent gets 10 years. Rational self-interest leads to 5 years each, worse than cooperation. | In business: PRICE WAR. Both keep prices high = both profitable. One cuts prices = gains share (temporarily). Both cut = both lose margin. | OPEC: Each country benefits from cheating on quotas, but if all cheat, oil price collapses. Tit-for-tat strategy: cooperate first, then mirror opponent's last move.",
